    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "your hand",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Your starting hand (only you see it):"
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "label": "hand sizes",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Each player holds 8 cards. Seat 1: {players[0].hand_size}, Seat 2: {players[1].hand_size}."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "next round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trump",
      "label": "suit pair",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number == trump_round"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == 2"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Clubs and Diamonds",
          "Clubs and Hearts",
          "Clubs and Spades",
          "Diamonds and Hearts",
          "Diamonds and Spades",
          "Hearts and Spades"
        ]
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "suit_pair",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "trump_options",
              "value": {
                "calc": "['Clubs', 'Hearts'] if $answer == 'Clubs and Hearts' else (['Clubs', 'Spades'] if $answer == 'Clubs and Spades' else (['Diamonds', 'Hearts'] if $answer == 'Diamonds and Hearts' else (['Diamonds', 'Spades'] if $answer == 'Diamonds and Spades' else (['Hearts', 'Spades'] if $answer == 'Hearts and Spades' else ['Clubs', 'Diamonds']))))"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} offers the suit pair: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Choose the pair of suits from which seat 1 will pick trump."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trump",
      "label": "trump suit",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number == trump_round"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "trump_options"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "trump",
              "value": {
                "calc": "1 if $answer == 'Diamonds' else (2 if $answer == 'Hearts' else (3 if $answer == 'Spades' else 0))"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} chooses {value} as trump."
      },
      "text": "Seat 2 offered {suit_pair}. Choose one of these two suits as trump."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trump",
      "label": "first attacker",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number == trump_round"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attacker",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if min([c for c in players[0].hand if c // cards_per_suit == trump] + [deck_size]) < min([c for c in players[1].hand if c // cards_per_suit == trump] + [deck_size]) else 2"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Trump is suit {trump} (0 Clubs, 1 Diamonds, 2 Hearts, 3 Spades). Seat {attacker} attacks first."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "reset the bout",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "table_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attack_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_unset"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defence_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_unset"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "throw_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_unset"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defender_took",
            "value": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "attack",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == attacker"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "hand"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer)"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "table_cards",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer)"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "attack_card",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer)"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} attacks with card {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are the attacker. Play any card from your hand (card id: suit = id // 9, rank = id % 9 + 6). Trump is suit {trump}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "defence options",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != attacker"
            },
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['TAKE'] + [d for d in you.hand if (d // cards_per_suit == attack_card // cards_per_suit and d > attack_card) or (d // cards_per_suit == trump and attack_card // cards_per_suit != trump)]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "defence",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != attacker"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'TAKE' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'TAKE'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "table_cards",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'TAKE' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'TAKE'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "defence_card",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'TAKE' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'TAKE'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "defender_took",
              "value": true,
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer == 'TAKE'"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} defends: {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are defending against card {attack_card} (trump suit {trump}). Beat it with one of the offered cards, or TAKE to pick up the table."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "throw-in options",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == attacker"
            },
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['PASS'] + ([c for c in you.hand if c % cards_per_suit == attack_card % cards_per_suit or (defence_card != card_unset and c % cards_per_suit == defence_card % cards_per_suit)] if (defender_took or sum([len(p.hand) for p in players if p.seat != you.seat]) >= 1) and len(you.hand) >= 1 else [])"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "throw-in",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == attacker"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'PASS' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'PASS'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "table_cards",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'PASS' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'PASS'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "throw_card",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'PASS' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'PASS'"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} throws in: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Throw in one card of the same rank as a card on the table ({table_cards}), or PASS. At most {max_throw_ins_per_bout} card per bout."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "second defence options",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round and throw_card != card_unset and not defender_took"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != attacker"
            },
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['TAKE'] + [d for d in you.hand if (d // cards_per_suit == throw_card // cards_per_suit and d > throw_card) or (d // cards_per_suit == trump and throw_card // cards_per_suit != trump)]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "bout",
      "label": "second defence",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round and throw_card != card_unset and not defender_took"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != attacker"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'TAKE' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'TAKE'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "table_cards",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer) if $answer != 'TAKE' else card_unset"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer != 'TAKE'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "defender_took",
              "value": true,
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer == 'TAKE'"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} defends the throw-in: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Card {throw_card} was thrown in (trump suit {trump}). Beat it with one of the offered cards, or TAKE to pick up the table."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "taken",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round and defender_took"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != attacker"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sorted(you.hand + table_cards)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "table_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Bout result: taken. The defender picks up the table cards; seat {attacker} attacks again."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "beaten off",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round and not defender_took"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard + table_cards"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "table_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attacker",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.seat != attacker][0]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Bout result: beaten off. The table cards go to the discard; seat {attacker} attacks next."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "hand sizes",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= first_bout_round"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_size",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(you.hand)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "bout",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Hand sizes: Seat 1 {players[0].hand_size}, Seat 2 {players[1].hand_size}. Bouts completed: {bout}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "label": "end check",
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "(round_number >= first_bout_round and (players[0].hand_size == 0 or players[1].hand_size == 0)) or round_number >= last_round"
      },
      "rank_by": "0 - you.hand_size",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final hand sizes: Seat 1 {players[0].hand_size}, Seat 2 {players[1].hand_size}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 40,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "CARDS. There are {deck_size} cards with ids 0 to 35. A card's suit is floor(id/{cards_per_suit}): 0 Clubs, 1 Diamonds, 2 Hearts, 3 Spades. Its rank is (id mod {cards_per_suit}) + {rank_offset}: 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, Jack 11, Queen 12, King 13, Ace 14. Two cards have the same rank when their ids are equal mod {cards_per_suit}.\n\nBEATING. A card d beats a card a if either (i) floor(d/9) = floor(a/9) and d > a, or (ii) floor(d/9) = trump and floor(a/9) is not trump. For example, with trump = 3, card 27 beats card 8, card 5 beats card 3, and card 3 does not beat card 5.\n\nSETUP. The deck is shuffled once. Seat 1 gets shuffled positions {seat1_first_position}-{seat1_last_position} and seat 2 gets positions {seat2_first_position}-{seat2_last_position}; both hands are sorted ascending. Positions {set_aside_first_position}-{set_aside_last_position} ({set_aside_size} cards) are set aside, never seen and never drawn from. You see only your own hand; each player starts with {hand_size} cards. Trump starts at {trump_unset} (unset), attacker at 0 (none), bout at 0, discard empty.\n\nROUND {trump_round} (trump choice). Seat 2 chooses one of {suit_pairs} pairs of suits: Clubs and Diamonds; Clubs and Hearts; Clubs and Spades; Diamonds and Hearts; Diamonds and Spades; Hearts and Spades. A missing or illegal answer means Clubs and Diamonds. Seat 1 then chooses one suit of that pair; a missing or illegal answer means the first suit named. That suit becomes trump and is announced. The first attacker is the seat holding the lowest-id card of the trump suit; if neither seat holds a trump, seat 2 attacks first.\n\nROUNDS {first_bout_round} to {last_round} (one bout per round). The defender is the seat that is not the attacker.\n1. Reset: table_cards empty, attack_card, defence_card and throw_card = {card_unset}, defender_took = false.\n2. Attack: the attacker plays any card from their hand (missing or illegal: their lowest id). It leaves their hand, goes to table_cards as attack_card and is shown to both.\n3-4. Defence: the defender is offered TAKE plus every card in their hand that beats attack_card. A missing or illegal answer means TAKE. If they play a card, it leaves their hand, goes to table_cards and becomes defence_card. If they choose TAKE, defender_took becomes true and the bout continues to the throw-in.\n5-6. Throw-in: the attacker is offered PASS, plus (only if the defender took or still holds at least 1 card, and the attacker holds at least 1 card) every card in their hand with the same rank as attack_card, or as defence_card if one was played. If the defender beat the attack with their last card, the only option is PASS. A missing or illegal answer means PASS. At most {max_throw_ins_per_bout} card is thrown in per bout; a thrown card leaves the attacker's hand, goes to table_cards as throw_card and is shown.\n7-8. Second defence: only if a card was thrown in and the defender has not taken. The defender is offered TAKE plus every card in their hand that beats throw_card. A chosen card goes to table_cards; TAKE sets defender_took = true; a missing or illegal answer means TAKE. If the defender had already taken, there is no second defence and the thrown card simply joins the table.\n9. Resolve: if defender_took is true, all table_cards go into the defender's hand (sorted), the attacker stays the attacker, and 'taken' is announced. Otherwise all table_cards go to the discard, the defender becomes the next attacker, and 'beaten off' is announced.\n10. Both hand sizes are updated and announced, and bout increases by 1.\n11. End check: if exactly one seat holds 0 cards, that seat wins and the game ends. If both hold 0, the game is a draw (shared result).\n\nAfter round {last_round}, if both still hold cards, the seat with fewer cards wins; equal counts are a draw (shared result)."
}
